<suitelet scriptid="customscript_fp_sl_emissao">
  <description>Emissao, consulta e reconciliacao do documento fiscal. Ato explicito, fora do save: emitir consome numeracao e e irreversivel. Aberto pelo botao injetado no beforeLoad da transacao.</description>
  <isinactive>F</isinactive>
  <name>FP Emissao</name>
  <notifyadmins>F</notifyadmins>
  <notifyemails></notifyemails>
  <notifyowner>T</notifyowner>
  <notifyuser>F</notifyuser>
  <scriptfile>[/SuiteScripts/FiscalPlatform/fp_sl_emissao.js]</scriptfile>
  <scriptcustomfields>
    <scriptcustomfield scriptid="custscript_fp_pasta_doc">
      <accesslevel>2</accesslevel>
      <applyformatting>F</applyformatting>
      <checkspelling>F</checkspelling>
      <defaultchecked>F</defaultchecked>
      <defaultselection></defaultselection>
      <defaultvalue></defaultvalue>
      <description>Internal id da pasta do File Cabinet onde o XML autorizado e gravado antes de ser anexado a transacao. Numero, nao lista. EM BRANCO NAO ANEXA, e o log avisa: a chave e o protocolo ja estao na transacao e a URL no customrecord_fp_doc, entao a falta do anexo nao perde a autorizacao.</description>
      <displayheight></displayheight>
      <displaytype>NORMAL</displaytype>
      <displaywidth></displaywidth>
      <dynamicdefault></dynamicdefault>
      <fieldtype>INTEGER</fieldtype>
      <help></help>
      <isformula>F</isformula>
      <ismandatory>F</ismandatory>
      <label>Pasta do XML</label>
      <linktext></linktext>
      <maxvalue></maxvalue>
      <minvalue></minvalue>
      <setting>COMPANY</setting>
      <storevalue>T</storevalue>
    </scriptcustomfield>
  </scriptcustomfields>
  <scriptdeployments>
    <scriptdeployment scriptid="customdeploy_fp_sl_emissao">
      <allemployees>F</allemployees>
      <allpartners>F</allpartners>
      <allroles>T</allroles>
      <audslctrole></audslctrole>
      <isdeployed>T</isdeployed>
      <loglevel>DEBUG</loglevel>
      <runasrole>ADMINISTRATOR</runasrole>
      <status>RELEASED</status>
      <title>FP Emissao</title>
    </scriptdeployment>
  </scriptdeployments>
</suitelet>
